{
	"name": "Inspiring Rhetoric",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/social/diplomacy-unity-alliance.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you become a revolutionary champion at 3rd level, you come to understand the power of a few words of well placed encouragement. You gain a number of Rhetoric Dice equal to your Charisma modifier. Each of these dice is 1d4. As a bonus action on your turn, you may grant one of these dice to the defensive target of your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.kdy4n7MRzAVYykI4]{Rise to the Challenge} class feature. If they do not use the die by the start of your next turn, it is lost, and you recover all uses at the end of a long rest. The die can be used in one of the following ways:</p><p><strong>Overcome:</strong> Gain expertise on a Strength or Dexterity skill or ability check.</p><p><strong>Recover:</strong> Regain 1d4 + your Charisma modifier in hit points.</p><p><strong>Resist:</strong> Gain expertise on a Wisdom or Charisma save against Fear, Charm, and Illusion effects.</p><p><strong>Strike:</strong> Add 1d4 damage to a successful weapon attack. The damage is of the same type as the weapon attack.</p>",
